{"id":"n71586-1-15","stage":3,"title":"어둠 · 黑暗","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71586-1-15-1","ko":"여기 성냥을 찾았어요!","zh":"我在这里找到了火柴！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}},{"text":"성냥을","meaning":"火柴","explanation":"성냥：火柴；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"성냥","audio":"/audio/d32a2356c403e5c50143.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63487","senseId":"1","lemma":"성냥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"성냥을","audio":"/audio/9adc5cdd119a426d45cd.mp3"}},{"text":"찾았어요!","meaning":"找到","explanation":"찾다：找到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"찾다","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57320","senseId":"1","lemma":"찾다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찾았어요","audio":"/audio/9fd43a34a16d05a77ce2.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"d32a2356c403e5c5","term":"성냥","zh":"火柴","audio":"/audio/d32a2356c403e5c50143.mp3","entryId":"63487","definition":"一种点火的工具，细小的木头片顶部沾有引火物质，只需在粗糙表面摩擦就可点火。","pronunciation":["성냥"]},{"id":"0aa19509314fd879","term":"찾다","zh":"找到","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3","entryId":"57320","definition":"找到","pronunciation":["찯따"]}],"audio":"/audio/bd8524ba196df85bb850.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71586-1-15-2","ko":"좋아. 얼른 불을 켜서 이 어둠을 밝히자고.","zh":"好啊。快点点火，把这片黑暗驱散吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"좋아.","meaning":"行，可以","explanation":"좋다：行，可以；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"12","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아","audio":"/audio/03b87f7121c91d1c28e1.mp3"}},{"text":"얼른","meaning":"快地","explanation":"얼른：快地。","readings":[{"term":"얼른","audio":"/audio/d658f46882498576d5d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67315","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼른","audio":"/audio/d658f46882498576d5d6.mp3"}},{"text":"불을","meaning":"火","explanation":"불：火；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"불","audio":"/audio/05e6efdf147502fc3ac3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61154","senseId":"2","lemma":"불","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"불을","audio":"/audio/a442b1b030964d74bceb.mp3"}},{"text":"켜서","meaning":"点着，打着，开","explanation":"켜다：点着，打着，开；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"켜다","audio":"/audio/c21cbaed08b52b5bb6d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72168","senseId":"1","lemma":"켜다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"켜서","audio":"/audio/f179c0f70da2253725a9.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"어둠을","meaning":"黑暗，昏暗","explanation":"어둠：黑暗，昏暗；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"어둠","audio":"/audio/80b84c9158d38546dba3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71586","senseId":"1","lemma":"어둠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어둠을","audio":"/audio/e055c28938846df5549b.mp3"}},{"text":"밝히자고.","meaning":"点亮，照亮","explanation":"밝히다：点亮，照亮；자고：重申一起行动的提议，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"밝히다","audio":"/audio/05491efb4d6e2bc679ff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58174","senseId":"1","lemma":"밝히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밝히자고","audio":"/audio/93e3e839a9261fba2590.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"行，可以","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某个行动或事情等不成问题。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"d658f46882498576","term":"얼른","zh":"快地","audio":"/audio/d658f46882498576d5d6.mp3","entryId":"67315","definition":"不拖延时间就。","pronunciation":["얼른"]},{"id":"05e6efdf147502fc","term":"불","zh":"火","audio":"/audio/05e6efdf147502fc3ac3.mp3","entryId":"61154","definition":"发出光亮、照亮黑暗的物体。","pronunciation":["불"]},{"id":"c21cbaed08b52b5b","term":"켜다","zh":"点着，打着，开","audio":"/audio/c21cbaed08b52b5bb6d4.mp3","entryId":"72168","definition":"点灯或蜡烛，或用火柴、打火机等点火。","pronunciation":["켜다"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"80b84c9158d38546","term":"어둠","zh":"黑暗，昏暗","audio":"/audio/80b84c9158d38546dba3.mp3","entryId":"71586","definition":"暗的状态或暗的时候。","pronunciation":["어둠"]},{"id":"05491efb4d6e2bc6","term":"밝히다","zh":"点亮，照亮","audio":"/audio/05491efb4d6e2bc679ff.mp3","entryId":"58174","definition":"用火或电灯等使暗处变亮。","pronunciation":["발키다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f8e34afd9f048f18d52f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.83,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71586","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":92,"sequenceScore":2.4834,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["好啊。快点点火，把这片黑暗驱散吧。","承奎现在在做什么？","我在这里找到了火柴！"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["好啊。快点点火，把这片黑暗驱散吧。","我在这里找到了火柴！","承奎现在在做什么？"],"answer":0}]}
